    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm running in circles. every time i think i finally have it under control i just mess it up again. it’s like this endless loop of trying and failing and feeling like absolute trash. i’m just so tired of the fight. feels like it’s never actually gonna change.",
